<resources>
    <!-- TV home: the single-row slot under the mini player (activity_tv_home's tvRvHome). Holds
         the tallest row whole: a channel row with its next-show line, and a poster row, whose
         posters the TV home shrinks to the same height (SmartHomeAdapter.TV_CARD_SCALE and
         TV_POSTER_SCALE; TvHomeRowSlotTest). The mini player takes the rest of the column. TVs
         are 540dp tall at any resolution, so the same split holds on 720p, 1080p and 4K panels. -->
    <dimen name="tv_home_row_slot">174dp</dimen>
</resources>
